  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FEASIBILITY STUDY TO ASSESS GEORGIA&#xbf;S PARTICIPATION IN THE ERASMUS+ PROGRAMME AND FOR RELEVANT CAPACITY BUILDING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The global objective is to support the Government of Georgia to assess Georgia&#xbf;s most appropriate, enhanced and efficient participation in the Erasmus+ Programme and to promote the lifelong learning, encourage cooperation and transparency at all levels of education and training as well as the youth and sport affairs, as provided for by the EU &#xbf; Georgia Association Agreement.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
